2.1.1 Electrical (EA) Scope

The Electrical Arrangement (EA) scope covers the necessary work required to expand the existing 230kV yard at Chatham SS to the East to include one new diameter for Scope A , along with a new Relay Building with AC/DC station services, new 'A' and 'B' cable trench throughout the east yard expansion and to/between the new / existing buildings.

EA 'Scope A' work is summarized below:

· Expand 230kV yard to Bay XV and XVI for a new diameter on the East per Stage Development Diagram DWG 309996ES and Basic Layout DWG NA86-50000-X001;

· Extend access service roads to a new area to accommodate scope A ;

· Install new fence for the extension to accommodate scope A ;

· Modify one existing diameter at Bay XII;

· Install three 230 kV, 3000A dead tank breakers (3CB24, 3CB26 and 3CB28);

- Install one new 208VAC, 80A ATS for each breaker (total three ATS);

- Install two 208VAC, 100A SF6 gas cart safety switches near breaker in the yard;

· Install six 230kV, 3000A motorized breaker disconnect switches (3DS24A/B, 3DS26A/B, 3DS28A/B);

· Install two 230kV, 2000 A motorized line disconnect switches with manual ground switches (3DS-L24 and 3DS- L26);

· Install two sets of three 230 kV single-phase line CVT (3CVT-L24 and 3CVT-L26, total six CVT);

- Install two CVT fuse boxes (one 'A' & one 'B') for each set of three CVT (total four fuse boxes)

· Install one new 230kV Relay Building;

- Install two 112.5VA, 600V-120/208V indoor transformers and two AC indoor distribution panels 120/208V 400 A;

- Install two DC indoor distribution panels 250 VDC 400 A;

- Install building lighting per DWG NA86-56160-X006 provided by HONI.

 3

 B&M: H1 - CHATHAM SS- ENGINEERING SERVICE | JULY 2022 | 705-2229540700-PRO-E0001-03

· Install two new 150kVA, 600V-120/208V pad-mounted transformers and two AC outdoor distribution panels 120/208V 400A for new diameter;

· Install two new 75kVA, 600V-120/208V pad-mounted transformers and two AC indoor distribution panels 120/208V 225A for Control Building;

. Replace one indoor 9KVA transformer TSS12 and AC panel AC12 with 75kVA 600V-120/208V pad mount transformer and one AC indoor distribution panel 120/208V 225A for Compressor Building;

· Install light fixtures for the extended yard;

- Install new yard lighting control panel in the new relay building;

- Install new yard lighting power supply panel on the same structure as AC panels in the yard;

. Install new Oldcastle 'A' and 'B' cable trench network between existing / new building & yard new electrical equipment;

· Extend the station ground grid with 4/0 bare copper to the extended yard to accommodate scopes A;

. AC load study of the new installation portion and verify the proposed station service transformer size to accommodate scope A;

· AC station service system arc flash study including load flow, cable size verification, voltage drop, fuse coordination, and short circuit study with SKM software. Study will be completed for scope A and B at the same time;

· DC load study to determine new 'A' and 'B' battery and charger sizes;

· Grounding Study for extension area;

· Cable trench sizing and filling validation to accommodate scope A;

· Lightning protection study for new expansion yard with SESShield-3D software to accommodate scope A;

· Sag-tension calculation for strain bus to accommodate scope A;

· Heat rejection calculations for all three buildings for HVAC design.

· Tetra Tech will follow the HONI 230kV 8-inch rigid bus standard design of 63kA.

· Conduct 230kV strain bus study.

· Tetra Tech will perform the building lighting design per DWG NA86-56160-X006 provided by HONI per Appendix AH Building Specification Section 5.24.1 - Lighting System.

